  "cartes.texture.emission_noire": {"fr": "<b>Seuil d'émission {seuil} &gt; {max}</b> — la luminance de l'image dérivée ne dépasse jamais {max} (sur {px} pixels au dernier calcul) : l'émission sortira <b>noire</b>. ", "en": "<b>Emission threshold {seuil} &gt; {max}</b> — the luminance of the derived image never exceeds {max} (over {px} pixels in the last run): the emission will come out <b>black</b>. "},
